{"3700410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scope Battle Royale", "steam_appid": 3700410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4366310], "detailed_description": "<h1>About Scope</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Frequently Asked Questions - Scope Battle Royale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is Scope free to play?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes! Scope is free to play on Steam for Windows users.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How many players are in each match?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against up to <strong>100 players</strong> in a match, but this number can change in custom sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can I play with friends?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes. Queue into matches solo, with a partner, or as a squad. First join a game and then invite your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Does Scope receive updates?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absolutely. Scope receives all sorts of updates featuring new content, gameplay improvements, map changes, live events, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are there bots in matches?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players may encounter bots to help ease them into the game and fill empty space to ensure you always have access to the battlefield. As matchmaking improves, you'll face more real players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will there be new maps?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes. Scope's world evolves over time through seasonal updates, and additional maps are planned for the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are there cosmetics?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kind of. Players can select different skins that come with the base game, or they can purchase a DLC and unlock other skins.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Does Scope have cross-platform play?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not at this time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is Scope pay-to-win?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No<strong>.</strong> Gameplay is built around player skill, strategy, and teamwork. Purchasable content is cosmetic and does not provide any gameplay advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where can I report bugs or share feedback?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community through the Steam Discussions or our Discord server to report bugs, suggest features, and help shape the future of Scope. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/extras/1ea513523ec1b4fa2261c5d45a3ee9f5.avif?t=1784862694\" width=624 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome warriors! Do you enjoy intense firefights? Do you love to blow things up? If so, Scope is perfect for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scope</strong> is a free-to-play tactical Battle Royale where <strong>100 players</strong> fight to become the last one standing. Every match is a test of strategy, precision, and survival as players battle across a mysterious island filled with evolving locations, powerful weapons, and hidden secrets. With regular seasonal updates, no two seasons are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/extras/26432fbf13fec09384866f305cb36fb1.avif?t=1784862694\" width=624 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap from the transport plane and choose your landing zone carefully. Whether you prefer isolated compounds, dense forests, towering mountains, or high-risk landmarks, every decision shapes your path to victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search quickly, other players are already hunting for gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/extras/ee7e556923b8cffc1543f2b20f8c8970.avif?t=1784862694\" width=624 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search buildings, Loot crates, and hidden locations for weapons, explosives, healing items, and other equipment. Every weapon offers a different playstyle, rewarding accuracy, positioning, and smart decision-making over reckless aggression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your loadout to survive every encounter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/extras/a76d295c2b39c11fbc0ea318ab6e310e.avif?t=1784862694\" width=624 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay one step ahead as the battlefield grows more dangerous. The shrinking safe zone forces players into increasingly tense firefights where every movement matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with your squad, outsmart your opponents, and make every shot count on your journey to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/extras/26a6f9ca23fe107ceb3c84673622765a.avif?t=1784862694\" width=624 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one player or one squad, can claim the victory. Earn your place through skill, teamwork, and determination while experiencing an island that continues to evolve through seasonal updates, live events, and an expanding mystery waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Pick up your rifles, throw on your boots and become the next CHAMPION!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/extras/1ea513523ec1b4fa2261c5d45a3ee9f5.avif?t=1784862694\" width=624 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome warriors! Do you enjoy intense firefights? Do you love to blow things up? If so, Scope is perfect for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scope</strong> is a free-to-play tactical Battle Royale where <strong>100 players</strong> fight to become the last one standing. Every match is a test of strategy, precision, and survival as players battle across a mysterious island filled with evolving locations, powerful weapons, and hidden secrets. With regular seasonal updates, no two seasons are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/extras/26432fbf13fec09384866f305cb36fb1.avif?t=1784862694\" width=624 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap from the transport plane and choose your landing zone carefully. Whether you prefer isolated compounds, dense forests, towering mountains, or high-risk landmarks, every decision shapes your path to victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search quickly, other players are already hunting for gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/extras/ee7e556923b8cffc1543f2b20f8c8970.avif?t=1784862694\" width=624 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search buildings, Loot crates, and hidden locations for weapons, explosives, healing items, and other equipment. Every weapon offers a different playstyle, rewarding accuracy, positioning, and smart decision-making over reckless aggression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your loadout to survive every encounter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/extras/a76d295c2b39c11fbc0ea318ab6e310e.avif?t=1784862694\" width=624 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay one step ahead as the battlefield grows more dangerous. The shrinking safe zone forces players into increasingly tense firefights where every movement matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with your squad, outsmart your opponents, and make every shot count on your journey to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/extras/26a6f9ca23fe107ceb3c84673622765a.avif?t=1784862694\" width=624 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one player or one squad, can claim the victory. Earn your place through skill, teamwork, and determination while experiencing an island that continues to evolve through seasonal updates, live events, and an expanding mystery waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Pick up your rifles, throw on your boots and become the next CHAMPION!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Scope, a free-to-play tactical Battle Royale where 100 players fight for survival in strategic, slow-paced gunfights. Master different weapons, outplay your opponents, and uncover the mysteries hidden beneath the island through it's evolving lore.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/2552fff7c0711a5e8bb81777e6d81a0c39771683/header.jpg?t=1784862694", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/19c5d1c8a1c63f0e01a23786fc154f06ee15595a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784862694", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/19c5d1c8a1c63f0e01a23786fc154f06ee15595a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784862694", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 3700X or Intel i7-9700k<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 8GB, AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i9-12900K or AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 16GB, AMD Radeon RX 7800 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requi